@startuml UML组件图
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam componentBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam componentFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam componentFontSize 13
skinparam databaseBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
skinparam noteFontColor #5D4037
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60
title 图3-3  酒店预订系统组件图

[微信小程序] as MP
[PC 网页] as WEB
[门店后台] as STORE
[集团后台] as HQ
[API 网关\n鉴权 / 限流 / 幂等] as GW

[ M1 基础资料 ] as M1
[ M2 库存与价格 ] as M2
[ M3 预订与订单 ] as M3
[ M4 支付与退款 ] as M4
[ M5 前台履约 ] as M5
[ M6 报表与对账 ] as M6
[ M7 权限与审计 ] as M7

database "MySQL 主库" as DB
database "MySQL 从库" as RO
[Redis\n锁房 TTL] as REDIS
[支付网关] as PAY

MP --> GW
WEB --> GW
STORE --> GW
HQ --> GW

GW --> M3
GW --> M5
GW --> M6
GW --> M7

M2 --> M1 : 读取房型 / 基准价
M3 --> M2 : 预占 / 释放
M5 --> M2 : 入住 / 退房释放
M3 --> M4 : 创建支付单
M4 --> M3 : 支付结果回调
M4 --> PAY
M2 --> DB
M1 --> DB
M3 --> DB
M4 --> DB
M6 --> RO : 只读
M2 --> REDIS

note right of M6
  报表只读从库，不参与交易事务；
  导出走对象存储（S2），不阻塞下单
end note

note bottom of M7
  横切能力：鉴权、门店数据隔离、
  手机号脱敏、操作日志（异步写入）
end note

note bottom of M4
  支付结果由网关回调更新订单；
  通知由 S1 异步发送，主链不等待
end note

note left of M2
  防超卖唯一事实源：
  条件更新 + 唯一约束兜底。
  协议锁房写入 group_lock，按入住晚累加
  DailyInventory.groupLocked；到期由 S3 调度释放
end note

legend bottom
  层次：上 接入层 ｜ 中 应用服务（M1–M7，对应 7 个业务模块）｜ 下 基础设施
  支撑能力 S1 通知 / S2 导出 / S3 定时调度（订单超时、锁房到期、夜审 No-show）未单独画组件，部署见图3-7
endlegend

@enduml
